  "description": "+LIGHTWEIGHT\n\nWe have optimized the frame thickness of the iAerolight in critical areas to the maximum. And with our Hollow Core Internal Molding-HCIM modeling technology, we have maximized carbon stiffness in critical areas, achieving a weight of only 1,400 grams.\n\nBHZ BY SEG AUTOMOTIVE MOTOR\n\nExperience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance.\n\nAUTONOMY\n\nThe diagonal tube houses a 420Wh battery for a range of up to 105km. Add the additional XPro Dual Discharge, Plug & Ride battery and extend your range up to 145km.\n\nThe iAerolight operates at 100% without ever reducing the level of assistance, until the end of the battery discharge.\n\nBATTERY = 420WH + 180WH (XPro Dual Discharge) = 600WH\n\nAUTONOMY = 105km + 40km (XPro Dual Discharge) = 145km\n\nINTEGRATED SEATPOST SYSTEM\n\nHoused inside the seat tube for maximum bike aerodynamics and rigidity. With a completely effective and secure clamping system.\n\nQUICK LEVERS\n\nEasy to use (12mm) and completely hidden. No tools are needed for manipulation.\n\nUPGRADE KIT; REAR LIGHT PLANCK\n\nA rear light that integrates completely into the seat tube through an easily installable, tool-free magnetic system.\n\niBUTTONS\n\nTwo coin-sized wireless Bluetooth buttons that can be mounted anywhere on the handlebar with elastic bands, even under bar tape. Battery- powered wireless operation connects seamlessly via Bluetooth to your bike's system for instant control access.",
